name font-change
category Package
revision 40403
shortdesc Macros to change text and mathematics fonts in plain TeX
relocated 1
longdesc Macros to Change Text and Mathematics fonts in TeX: 45
longdesc Beautiful Variants The macros are written for plain TeX and may
longdesc be used with other packages like AmSTeX, eplain, etc. They also
longdesc work with XeTeX. The macros allow users to change the fonts
longdesc (for both text and mathematics) in their TeX document with only
longdesc one statement. The fonts may be used readily at various
longdesc predefined sizes. All the fonts called by these macro files are
longdesc free and are included in current MiKTeX and TeX Live
longdesc distributions.
runfiles size=135
